      "langue": "en",
      "text": "As the mayor of a small town you must keep your town looking its best. As the city infrastructure crumbles around you, lend a hand to fix things up. Control either the mayor or deputy mayor moving them around town. When near a crumbled building, repair it with A. Fix the entire city before time runs out!"
